{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swarm Queen is ready to invade the dimensions and gather as much DNA as she can. She will grant you incredible powers and enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/02c4614fb26db4931df870fef65ce1b5.avif?t=1760465174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras_big/02c4614fb26db4931df870fef65ce1b5.webp?t=1760465174 width=1560 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/76948bbbe6c15da4e35801b9d4c05903.poster.avif?t=1760465174\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/76948bbbe6c15da4e35801b9d4c05903.webm?t=1760465174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Hybrid and upgrade it to face increasingly difficult challenges. Infinite possibilities! You can hybridize your Dinosaur using DNA from various body parts collected during battle. In addition to changing the physical appearance and movements, its stats also change, so have fun experimenting with different builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/a8a716efbe7bc46345bef3a11d28389d.avif?t=1760465174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras_big/a8a716efbe7bc46345bef3a11d28389d.webp?t=1760465174 width=1560 height=312 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/1c2579b5611a58ae49cb68b378e6ac2e.poster.avif?t=1760465174\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/1c2579b5611a58ae49cb68b378e6ac2e.webm?t=1760465174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupt your Hybrid's DNA with various Elements\u00a0or merge the Powers with the Elements.\u00a0Level up your Hybrid or Powers by changing their stats and granting unique abilities based on the Element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/b30e87d0b45c06ecba88eeae551541ec.avif?t=1760465174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras_big/b30e87d0b45c06ecba88eeae551541ec.webp?t=1760465174 width=1560 height=284 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.poster.avif?t=1760465174\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.webm?t=1760465174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fuse the various Powers together by changing their physics and stats. This way you can create custom builds without limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade Dimensions to collect DNA, Powers and Elements. Each Dimension is different with different types of Enemies and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun experimenting and creating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3393190?t=1760465174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/496e2c86e34d6ab668ce3e498aecfdc2765ee731/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760465174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/c925e735483e2cdf6d5eaa2739372dc2010e12f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760465174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/c925e735483e2cdf6d5eaa2739372dc2010e12f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760465174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3999250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swarm Queen is ready to invade the dimensions and gather as much DNA as she can. She will grant you incredible powers and enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/02c4614fb26db4931df870fef65ce1b5.avif?t=1760465174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras_big/02c4614fb26db4931df870fef65ce1b5.webp?t=1760465174 width=1560 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s