ng unique abilities based on the Element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/b30e87d0b45c06ecba88eeae551541ec.avif?t=1760465174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras_big/b30e87d0b45c06ecba88eeae551541ec.webp?t=1760465174 width=1560 height=284 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.poster.avif?t=1760465174\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.webm?t=1760465174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fuse the various Powers together by changing their physics and stats. This way you can create custom builds without limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade Dimensions to collect DNA, Powers and Elements. Each Dimension is different with different types of Enemies and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun experimenting and creating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ChaosPower"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393190/31904e26b095243d6229f57f681dcd62c3a38da8/header.jpg?t=1760465174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.80 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:<